  "content": "\n\n<h1>靈魂綁定附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-soulbound-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ly-soulbound-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><code>靈魂綁定</code> 附魔會在您死亡時將物品歸還給您。</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<p>若 <code>doImmediateRespawn</code> 遊戲規則設為 <code>true</code>，則不相容。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>❗ 相容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-graves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Graves</a> 相容！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤/問題</h2>\n<p>請於 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題或錯誤。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot soulbound_enchantment:soulbound</code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s soulbound_enchantment:soulbound</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器